        "link": "https://world.digimoncard.com/rule/?card_no=BT17-102#qaResult_card",
        "num": 1,
        "text": "Official English Q&A for BT17-102 (Sep. 6, 2024)"
      }
    ],
    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "Yes. \"This Digimon gains all the names...\" means that it also gains the names from (Rule) on digivolution cards.",
        "question": "Does this card's [All Turns] effect also give it the names from (Rule) on level 3 or lower cards in its digivolution cards?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, Tamer cards and Option cards don't have levels, therefore they don't meet the \"level 3 or lower cards\" condition and their names aren't gained.",
        "question": "Does this card's [All Turns] effect also give it the names from Tamer cards and Option cards in its digivolution cards?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, you can't.  \"Hatch a Digi-Egg\" means taking the top card of your Digi-Egg deck and placing it face-up in the breeding area.",
        "question": "Can I use this card's [On Deletion] effect to hatch a Tamer card with [Tai Kamiya] in the breeding area?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
  },
